  "_finer_flags_note": "v2 finer flags (2026-06-26) to break flag-domination so every champ can be #1. Each grounded in _ability_text.json + adversarially verified.",
  "_untargetability_audit_note": "2026-07-02 audit: untargetability/invulnerability removed where the effect is a death passive (Karthus/Kog Maw/Sion — revive flag covers those), ally-targeted (Zilean Chronoshift, Kalista Oathsworn stasis), enemy-targeted (Poppy R flight) or absent (Syndra). Death passives are NOT a separate flag: revive already means post-lethal action. Unresolved (wiki category vs missing DDragon text — verify at wiki level before touching): Aurora, Galio, Kindred(I), Kled, K Sante, Ryze, Tahm Kench, Urgot, Viego, Zaahen, Zac."
